<title>USA: Aero Systems gets $7 million in contracts.</title>
<headline>Aero Systems gets $7 million in contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aero Systems Engineering Inc said Friday it landed two contracts worth a total of more than $7 million, raising orders for the year to date to more than $19 million.</p>
<p>Aero Systems said one contract was for the design and construction of an aircraft turbine engine test facility for United Technologies Corp unit Pratt &amp; Whitney of Columbus, Georgia.</p>
<p>The other contract is for an open jet wind tunnel for Sundstrand Aerospace of Rockford, Illinois.</p>
<p>Aero Systems is a member of the Celsius Group, based in Stockholm.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
